# Google OAuth Configuration
# Get your Client ID from: https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=your_google_client_id_here.apps.googleusercontent.com

# Supabase Configuration
# Get these from: https://supabase.com/dashboard/project/_/settings/api
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your_supabase_anon_key_here

# Instructions:
# 1. Copy this file to .env
# 2. Replace 'your_google_client_id_here' with your actual Google OAuth Client ID
# 3. Replace Supabase URL and Anon Key with your project credentials
# 4. Enable Google Sign-In in Google Cloud Console
# 5. Add authorized JavaScript origins: http://localhost:5173, https://yourdomain.com
# 6. Add authorized redirect URIs: http://localhost:5173, https://yourdomain.com

